Company’s existing operations in order to realize the anticipated benefits of the BMC Merger:
• managing a larger company and meeting our capital requirements;
• integrating personnel from the two companies and maintaining employee morale;
• integrating the companies’ technologies;
• integrating and unifying the offerings and services available to customers;
• identifying and eliminating redundant and under performing locations, functions and assets;
• harmonizing the companies’ operating practices, employee development and compensation programs, internal controls and other policies,
